msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Seems like we could've done a lot better. Let's put in more\r\n"
"effort next time, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"No problem! I can put in more effort! In fact, I can put in\r\n"
"a lot more effort! Watch, I'm gonna nail this for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Good work out there tonight. I think you're getting the hang\r\n"
"of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Yeah, I kinda feel that too! Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Great job out there tonight. I could tell you were giving it\r\n"
"your all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "My pleasure! That's what I'm here to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Let's work on your presentation. Makeup, hair, posture...\r\n"
"All of these things send certain signals to a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Sounds juicy. Tell me more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "All right, I think that just about covers it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Not bad, Kiryu-san! You're more perceptive than I thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Hmm... I honestly think you have a ways to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Okay, well... You think I need to arch my back a bit more?\r\n"
"Puff out my chest? Stick out my butt? Which is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Okay, so today we're going to study a little trivia. No\r\n"
"matter what the conversation, it's always important to be\r\n"
"smart about what you say. \"Knowledge is power,\" right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"\"Knowledge is power.\" I like that. I'm gonna use that\r\n"
"sometime. Okay, let's do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "All right, that should be more than enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Yeah, I bet you I could win a quiz show after all that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Hmm... I'm not quite sure you got the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "No, I'm pretty sure I... Hmm. Okay, maybe you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"Right now, I'd like to give you some conversation tips to\r\n"
"help you captivate the customers. Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Am I not captivating enough? Ahahaha. For real, though.\r\n"
"I'm all ears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "All right, I think you've pretty much got it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "I do!? Oh, I mean... Yeah! Of course! Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Hmm... I think you could still use a little work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Noooooooooo... Ahhhhh, I knew that's what you'd say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"I think you should spend your downtime doing whatever you\r\n"
"like. You've definitely earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"Thanks! You... wouldn't happen to have a phone charger\r\n"
"lying around somewhere, would you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"Did you make the most of your time? You seem pretty\r\n"
"energetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "Yeah, totally! Ready to get back into the fray!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Hmm... Are you sure you're doing okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"...Let's be real here. I need, like, 45 more minutes of\r\n"
"chill time. That's... not possible, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to work on your weak points. Now I know I\r\n"
"might come off a little blunt, but bear with it, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "...Eep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"All right, now think about what I told you and give it your\r\n"
"full effort next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Huh. You know... You may just have a point there. Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "(I don't think any of that really got through to her...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "...Well. Better get back to working my ass off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"I think you should take some time off for yourself and relax\r\n"
"to your heart's content. Do what's good for %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "You won't see me complaining! Thanks, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "So, how was your time off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Good! I finally got everything that's been piling up done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "So, did you enjoy yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "...It was a nightmare. Wanna hear about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to find a way to keep you motivated and\r\n"
"help you stay positive. How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "Fine by me. What's the plan, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid "Well? How's that for positive thinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "...You should really write a book on this stuff. I'm sold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "Well? Do you feel more positive now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "The opposite, actually. You... weren't serious, were you?"
msgstr ""

